---
// The two columns of the home page: each holds a cloud of pain and, under it, what answers it
// (see Pair.astro). On a phone the columns stack: cloud, its answer, next cloud, its answer.
---

<div class="not-content pairs"><slot /></div>

<style>
  .pairs {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 3rem;
    margin: 1.4rem 0 0;
  }
  @media (min-width: 62rem) {
    .pairs {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      column-gap: 3.5rem;
      row-gap: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
